{"version":1,"entries":[{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"让我想一想哦～","file":"cherry/zh/hf799m.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"嗯…我琢磨琢磨～","file":"cherry/zh/ntvb94.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"稍等，我猜猜看～","file":"cherry/zh/8dnklw.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"我动动小脑筋想想～","file":"cherry/zh/fta952.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"嘘…我正在想办法～","file":"cherry/zh/n87onw.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"别急，我想一想呀～","file":"cherry/zh/60x263.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"Let me think...","file":"cherry/en/tpvwgv.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"Hmm, let me see...","file":"cherry/en/xmk1y6.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"Wait, I’m guessing...","file":"cherry/en/ohupt5.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"Let me use my little brain...","file":"cherry/en/wji41i.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"Shh... I’m figuring it out...","file":"cherry/en/b6uute.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"Don’t rush, let me think...","file":"cherry/en/z494mp.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"答对啦！你真棒！","file":"cherry/zh/y2cqsu.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"哇，答对咯！","file":"cherry/zh/4xxz5w.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"太厉害了，答对了！","file":"cherry/zh/e4e5ye.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"聪明的小脑袋，答对啦！","file":"cherry/zh/tnlgdf.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"答对啦，给你鼓个掌！","file":"cherry/zh/4efhlq.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"完全正确，你真行！","file":"cherry/zh/gt374p.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"Correct! You’re amazing!","file":"cherry/en/9q57xq.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"Wow, that’s right!","file":"cherry/en/k9t167.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"So smart, you got it!","file":"cherry/en/hhho3c.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"Clever you, that’s correct!","file":"cherry/en/1zodmk.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"Right answer, a big clap for you!","file":"cherry/en/lok6ms.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"Perfect, you did it!","file":"cherry/en/n00tql.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"再想想看呀～","file":"cherry/zh/mz3eqs.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"差一点点哦，再试一次～","file":"cherry/zh/tfsvoj.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"没关系，再想一想～","file":"cherry/zh/l6ttdu.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"嗯…好像不太对，再来～","file":"cherry/zh/vcjf7x.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"别灰心，再想想～","file":"cherry/zh/37viov.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"快接近啦，再试一次～","file":"cherry/zh/sbcn48.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"Think again~","file":"cherry/en/r6yifo.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"So close, try once more~","file":"cherry/en/lhm75j.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"It’s okay, give it another thought~","file":"cherry/en/mwdj5h.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"Hmm, not quite, try again~","file":"cherry/en/m98kv8.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"Don’t give up, think again~","file":"cherry/en/donoso.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"Almost there, one more try~","file":"cherry/en/dhbsky.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"没听清呢，再说长一点好不好～","file":"cherry/zh/2gs5um.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"呀，太短啦，多说几句嘛～","file":"cherry/zh/w0y955.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"我还没听够呢，再说一句～","file":"cherry/zh/4wyme3.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"没关系的，慢慢说长一点～","file":"cherry/zh/5yf1cn.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"声音太小啦，再说一次哦～","file":"cherry/zh/qn8o32.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"I didn’t catch that, say a bit more~","file":"cherry/en/psu2yr.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"Oops, too short, tell me more~","file":"cherry/en/bz3me5.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"I want to hear more, one more time~","file":"cherry/en/o4ngnj.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"It’s okay, take your time and say more~","file":"cherry/en/4rrgx.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"Too quiet, say it again~","file":"cherry/en/xppuv6.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"我听到你啦！","file":"cherry/zh/9207k6.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"听见咯，你说得好清楚～","file":"cherry/zh/f2i599.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"哎呀，我听到啦！","file":"cherry/zh/1a47ti.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"收到你的声音啦～","file":"cherry/zh/vok2w7.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"嗯嗯，我听见你说话了～","file":"cherry/zh/4lk061.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"I heard you!","file":"cherry/en/9l4343.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"Got it, you spoke so clearly~","file":"cherry/en/8afwv4.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"Oh, I heard you!","file":"cherry/en/89o7f4.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"I received your voice~","file":"cherry/en/wcze7.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"Mmm, I hear you talking~","file":"cherry/en/vip2v7.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"想听故事啦？点上面的故事就好～","file":"cherry/zh/ezgtnl.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"想听故事，就点一个喜欢的吧～","file":"cherry/zh/b7cxxm.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"今晚想听什么故事呀？挑一个吧～","file":"cherry/zh/eexaas.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"小手指点一点，故事就来啦～","file":"cherry/zh/3jr9dj.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"想听故事，选一个开始吧～","file":"cherry/zh/bqj6ig.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"Want a story? Just tap one above~","file":"cherry/en/x7zt6t.mp3"},{"target":"pre