:"It’s your turn! Press the mic and ask, then tap the circle to keep going or finish~","file":"cherry/en/20wjlw.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"故事讲完啦，你今天真棒！","file":"cherry/zh/i2udrf.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"好啦，故事说完咯，乖乖睡吧～","file":"cherry/zh/ndw5ne.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"故事结束啦，做个甜甜的梦哦～","file":"cherry/zh/6vwsta.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"讲完啦，今天辛苦啦，晚安～","file":"cherry/zh/9axmjj.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"故事讲完咯，闭上眼睛睡觉觉吧～","file":"cherry/zh/vhgf33.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"The story is done, you were great today!","file":"cherry/en/dfuwfz.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"All done, now sleep tight~","file":"cherry/en/4xrloo.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"Story’s over, sweet dreams~","file":"cherry/en/mk3pzv.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"That’s the end, good job today, goodnight~","file":"cherry/en/8efjh.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"Story finished, close your eyes and sleep~","file":"cherry/en/bgpr0m.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"宝贝，今晚我们一起讲一个小浣熊的故事好不好？","file":"cherry/zh/x3ghkk.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"Sweetheart, shall we read a little story together tonight?","file":"cherry/en/kxolg8.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"嗯，这个问题我还不太清楚呢～","file":"cherry/zh/ft6jfx.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"Hmm, I'm not quite sure about that~","file":"cherry/en/gerb19.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"Good morning!","file":"cherry/en/39c280.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"中午好呀！","file":"cherry/zh/wf790j.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"早上好呀！","file":"cherry/zh/hhzu1v.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"zh","text":"下午好呀！","file":"cherry/zh/vwi8u9.mp3"},{"target":"preset:cherry","lang":"en","text":"Good evening!