e":"serena/zh/op2z62.mp3"},{"target":"preset:serena","lang":"en","text":"Now it’s your turn! Hold the mic and tell me your question. After I answer, tap the round button to ask another, or tap finish when done~","file":"serena/en/dteqit.mp3"},{"target":"preset:serena","lang":"en","text":"Your turn to ask! Hold the mic, say your question, then tap the circle to continue or finish when ready~","file":"serena/en/p2gl6m.mp3"},{"target":"preset:serena","lang":"en","text":"It’s your turn! Press the mic and ask, then tap the circle to keep going or finish~","file":"serena/en/20wjlw.mp3"},{"target":"preset:serena","lang":"zh","text":"故事讲完啦，你今天真棒！","file":"serena/zh/i2udrf.mp3"},{"target":"preset:serena","lang":"zh","text":"好啦，故事说完咯，乖乖睡吧～","file":"serena/zh/ndw5ne.mp3"},{"target":"preset:serena","lang":"zh","text":"故事结束啦，做个甜甜的梦哦～","file":"serena/zh/6vwsta.mp3"},{"target":"preset:serena","lang":"zh","text":"讲完啦，今天辛苦啦，晚安～","file":"serena/zh/9axmjj.mp3"},{"target":"preset:serena","lang":"zh","text":"故事讲完咯，闭上眼睛睡觉觉吧～","file":"serena/zh/vhgf33.mp3"},{"target":"preset:serena","lang":"en","text":"The story is done, you were great today!","file":"serena/en/dfuwfz.mp3"},{"target":"preset:serena","lang":"en","text":"All done, now sleep tight~","file":"serena/en/4xrloo.mp3"},{"target":"preset:serena","lang":"en","text":"Story’s over, sweet dreams~","file":"serena/en/mk3pzv.mp3"},{"target":"preset:serena","lang":"en","text":"That’s the end, good job today, goodnight~","file":"serena/en/8efjh.mp3"},{"target":"preset:serena","lang":"en","text":"Story finished, close your eyes and sleep~","file":"serena/en/bgpr0m.mp3"},{"target":"preset:serena","lang":"zh","text":"宝贝，今晚我们一起讲一个小浣熊的故事好不好？","file":"serena/zh/x3ghkk.mp3"},{"target":"preset:serena","lang":"en","text":"Sweetheart, shall we read a little story together tonight?","file":"serena/en/kxolg8.mp3"},{"target":"preset:serena","lang":"zh","text":"嗯，这个问题我还不太清楚呢～","file":"serena/zh/ft6jfx.mp3"},{"target":"preset:serena","lang":"en","text":"H